IssueRegionalBulletinCommand -[hidden]down- RecordDamageAssessmentCommand
UploadPestEvidencePhotoCommand -[hidden]down- ScheduleFieldInspectionCommand
NotifyAssignedAgronomistCommand -[hidden]down- CompleteFieldInspectionCommand
RecordDamageAssessmentCommand -[hidden]down- IssueTechnicalPrescriptionCommand
ScheduleFieldInspectionCommand -[hidden]down- ConfirmTreatmentApplicationCommand
