SatelliteMonitoringScheduledEvent -[hidden]down- NDVIIndexComputedEvent
SatelliteImageryIngestedEvent -[hidden]down- NDWIIndexComputedEvent
CloudyImageryDiscardedEvent -[hidden]down- ClimateForecastUpdatedEvent
NDVIIndexComputedEvent -[hidden]down- VegetationAnomalyDetectedEvent
NDWIIndexComputedEvent -[hidden]down- WaterStressDetectedEvent
ClimateForecastUpdatedEvent -[hidden]down- FrostRiskDetectedEvent
VegetationAnomalyDetectedEvent -[hidden]down- AgroclimaticAlertRaisedEvent
WaterStressDetectedEvent -[hidden]down- AlertNotificationSentEvent
FrostRiskDetectedEvent -[hidden]down- ActionStepCompletedEvent
AgroclimaticAlertRaisedEvent -[hidden]down- AlertMitigatedEvent
AlertNotificationSentEvent -[hidden]down- RegionalBulletinIssuedEvent
ActionStepCompletedEvent -[hidden]down- PestEvidencePhotoUploadedEvent
AlertMitigatedEvent -[hidden]down- AgronomistNotifiedEvent
RegionalBulletinIssuedEvent -[hidden]down- DamageAssessmentRecordedEvent
PestEvidencePhotoUploadedEvent -[hidden]down- FieldInspectionScheduledEvent
