DamageAssessmentRecordedEvent -[hidden]down- TechnicalPrescriptionIssuedEvent
FieldInspectionScheduledEvent -[hidden]down- TreatmentApplicationConfirmedEvent
FieldInspectionCompletedEvent -[hidden]down- FoliageRecoveryReportedEvent
