MonitoringController -[hidden]down- SatelliteObservationResourceFromEntityAssembler
AdvisoryController -[hidden]down- PestReportResourceFromEntityAssembler
IssuePrescriptionCommandFromResourceAssembler -[hidden]down- SatelliteMonitoringCommandServiceImpl
IssuePrescriptionCommandFromResourceAssembler -[hidden]down- AgronomicAdvisoryCommandServiceImpl
SatelliteMonitoringCommandServiceImpl -[hidden]down- CropHealthQueryServiceImpl
AgronomicAdvisoryCommandServiceImpl -[hidden]down- CropHealthQueryServiceImpl
CropHealthQueryServiceImpl -[hidden]down- SowingDateRecordedEventHandler
CropHealthQueryServiceImpl -[hidden]down- AgroclimaticAlertRaisedEventHandler
